      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>Vetch: forty-eight irdabbs. Seed: [</li>\n<li>Chickpeas: five irdabbs. Clover: Four [</li>\n<li>Included is the seed-advance that the report indicated</li>\n<li>was issued by \u02beIdr\u012bs ibn \u02beIs\u1e25aq for cultivation in the kar\u0101j\u012b year\u00a0</li>\n<li>four-hundred and thirty. The whole: nine-hundred and eighty-eight irdabbs.</li>\n<li>Produce: Three-hundred and seventy-four irdabbs.</li>\n<li>Included in this:</li>\n<li>What is contained in his account: Three-hundred and sixty-seven irdabbs. </li></ol>\n",
